# ============================================================================
# Epistemic Resonance Protocol — N4L arrow definitions
#
# These relations are used by the coordinator zome's N4L export
# (dna/coordinator/src/lib.rs, ToN4L trait) and must be loaded alongside
# SSTorytime's standard SSTconfig/ arrow files before ingesting exported
# .dat files with the N4L compiler.
#
# VERIFICATION STATUS: this file and the exporter that depends on it have
# been checked by hand against the published N4L spec
# (https://github.com/markburgess/SSTorytime/blob/main/docs/N4L.md) but
# have NOT been run through the real N4L Go binary. Before relying on
# this in production, run the actual export through `N4L -v` (or `-d`
# for diagnostics) with this file present in SSTconfig/ and confirm it
# parses without errors. "Matches the spec as read" and "actually
# parses" are different claims until that check happens.
#
# Per SSTorytime's four-type model (see docs/N4L.md):
#   0 similarity  — undirected closeness
#   1 leadsto     — causal/temporal order, one thing follows/affects another
#   2 contains    — membership, part-of
#   3 properties  — descriptive attributes
# ============================================================================

- leadsto

    # A critique doesn't just describe a claim, it acts on its standing —
    # so it's causal/affecting, not merely descriptive.
    + critiques (crit)       - is critiqued by (critby)
    + contradicts (contra)   - is contradicted by (contraby)
    + adopts species (adopts) - is adopted by (adoptby)
    + retracts (retr)        - is retracted by (retrby)
    + replaced by (replby)   - replaces (repl)
    + promoted to (promto)   - promoted from (promfrom)
    + replies to (replyto)   - has reply (hasreply)
    + imported from (impfrom) - was imported to (impto)

- contains

    + has evidence (ev)      - is evidence for (evfor)
    + requires promise (reqp) - is required promise of (reqpof)
    + covers period (covp)   - is period of (covpof)
    + has promise (haspr)    - is promise of (prof)
    + has condition (hascond) - is condition of (condof)

- properties

    + asserted by (assertby)   - is the assertion of (assertof)
    + has domain (dom)         - is domain of (domof)
    + has confidence (conf)    - is confidence of (confof)
    + critique mode (cmode)    - is mode of critique (cmodeof)
    + has tag (tag)            - is tag of (tagof)
    + has source url (srcurl)  - is url source for (srcurlof)
    + evidence type (evtype)   - is type of evidence (evtypeof)
    + bridged via (bridge)     - is bridge for (bridgeof)
    + bridge id (bridgeid)     - is bridge id of (bridgeidof)
    + has description (desc)   - describes (descof)
    + created by (createdby)   - is creator of (creatorof)
    + expires at (expat)       - is expiry of (expof)
    + has checksum (chk)       - is checksum of (chkof)
    + has expertise tag (exp)  - is expertise tag of (expof2)
    + sample action (sampact)  - is sample for (sampof)
    + has entry count (ecount) - is count of (ecountof)
    + promise action (promact) - is action of promise (promactof)
    + promise modality (mod)   - is modality of (modof)
    + condition type (condtype) - is type of condition (condtypeof)
    + founded on constitution (foundedon) - is constitution founding (foundingof)
    + target type (targtype)   - is target type of (targtypeof)
